<title>FINLAND: FINNISH KT-TIETOKESKUS Q1 PROFIT RISES 58 PCT.</title>
<headline>FINNISH KT-TIETOKESKUS Q1 PROFIT RISES 58 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to end-March,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     8.4 vs 5.3</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		    4.0 vs 2.2</p>
<p> Net sales					  274.2 vs 293.3</p>
<p> Operating profit				   7.8 vs 5.1</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	18.5 vs 14.8</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	  8.4 vs 5.3</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    48.3 vs 34.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish data services group is</p>
<p>KT-Tietokeskus Oy.</p>
